          <choice_text>PATCH(Planned Approach to Community Health)</choice_text>
          <commentary>PATCH는 지역사회 참여를 강조한 기획 모형이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
